// Section 21 hands the device over as the first line shows (introDeviceGive).
title: Your device
from: Zeke Torres
gist: Torres handed you your device: Mail, your Schedule, the Map and your Needs.
== lines
torres-zeke > you: And this is yours. Your device.   [gesture]
torres-zeke: Mail, Schedule, the Map, your Needs. The lot. Don't lose it.
? choice
* What do I do first?   rel:torres-zeke+1 flavour:practical
  torres-zeke: Dinner. Always dinner first. Then everything else.   [nod]
* Is it always this much?   rel:torres-zeke+1 flavour:share
  torres-zeke: First night, yes. By Thursday it's just home with a lift in it.   [nod]
* (Just nod)
  torres-zeke: Good. The quiet ones last longest.
torres-zeke: Right, onward. The mess is on Deck 3, and Brennan doesn't hold plates for anyone.   [gesture]
